# A measured Entry prints its pending Fuel row when it yields to read, then its final row when it settles (#2329).
> :clock virtual 2026-09-30T10:00:00Z
> :fuel ask console to read and wait
fuel {entry: "entry1", fuel: 14, state: "pending", interrupted: false, runs: 1, queued: 0}
< hi
fuel {entry: "entry1", fuel: 19, state: "complete", interrupted: false, runs: 0, queued: 0}
> :fuel
fuel {entry: "entry1", fuel: 19, state: "complete", interrupted: false, runs: 0, queued: 0}
